' Interactive App demonstration in Visual Basic X (VBX)
' Prompts for user input, writes to file, reads back, and presents results.

' 1. Prompt user for input using InputBox
Dim userName = InputBox("Please enter your name:", "Interactive App Registration")

' 2. Display greeting using MsgBox
MsgBox "Hello, " + userName + "! Saving your data to file...", "Welcome"

' 3. Save text to a file using File.Write
Dim logFile = "app_data.txt"
Dim fileContent = "Registered User: " + userName
File.Write logFile, fileContent

' 4. Read text back from the file using File.Read
Dim savedData = File.Read(logFile)

' 5. Present read content using MsgBox and Print
MsgBox "Read from " + logFile + ": " + savedData, "File I/O Complete"
Print "File content: " + savedData
